# Common — Quality Gates & Definition of Done

## Quality Gates (Hard Requirement)

All must pass before merge:

- JSON/YAML validation
- Docker Compose validation (`docker compose config`)
- n8n workflow validation (if applicable)
- Infrastructure tests (service health checks)
- Security scan (container vulnerability scan)
- Manual testing (workflow execution where applicable)
- Human approval
- CI success

No exceptions without documented approval.

## Definition of Done

A task is DONE only when:

- Configuration merged via PR
- CI passed
- Infrastructure tests exist (service validation where applicable)
- Docs updated (if needed)
- Services deployable and healthy
- Rollback possible
- Security checks passed
- Workflows/services function correctly
- Service logs are meaningful
